 "deployedMd": "## Email recovery (evaluation, TEST-ONLY)\n\nThe email-recovery contracts as `research/email-recovery/eval/testnet/run.mjs` deployed them for the evaluation (research/email-recovery/eval/README.md, \"Testnet\"), around Perch's deployment and Nido's factory above. Built from Nido commit `ab274154fdcb8a40da363a26c7fd114741303460` with `just build-contracts`; deployed 2026-11-02 with stellar 27.0.0 (5a7c5fe76530bf4248477ac812fc757146b98cc4). Every governing key is a throwaway testnet key, and the registry's only key is the Gmail provider mock's TEST-ONLY key: these contracts are not for real accounts.\n\n| Contract | Address | Wasm sha256 | Configuration |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `nido-email-verifier` | `CA5OTBHLEUHF6U5ELBHWM5ZRBD53EJCIYQKTBAV7ESIKNZSAY2ZVU257` | `5d7e195e…` | Constructorless; reports circuit id `a998d03e2069b41c…` (read back) |\n| `nido-dkim-registry` | `CDGCAISUZZMQ72O2LGV3DHQ34FGGR35ISI7OGJUZPQTR5Q5EFIRH654N` | `7e115ff9…` | 5 members, threshold 3, revocation 2; the DNS attester mock's 3 TEST-ONLY keys, threshold 2; grace 24 hours of close time; the launch allowlist. Proposal 1 (the Gmail mock's key) approved and attested, eligible from close time 1793883645 (Unix seconds) |\n| `nido-enclave-image-registry` | `CB7SKZHKWNUCGYDK6F7HLE26CDFGSNVTC2RSOD5NDEOXH6NOQHMWJ3CM` | `27ae9151…` | One signer `GCY2F5HG3WH2B4G63C6KG44YVYCVGXYWQXJGAGO7RTH6BCVFO3JRF2VF`, threshold 1; no measurement approved |\n| `nido-email-guardian` | wasm uploaded; one instance per account (the run's: `CB4ES7RLF3MJSRR4P2RQUBTVPFIJ5ABEXDOYBHIR65PLRM6IZQGOEA46`) | `e21515ae…` | — |\n\nDeployer `GDE5K4UTAC2UE53HXER4GCSPFS7UXYOXQBO22QUUKTAX7K3FWVZ3JARW`. Members: `GACCHJXQMCZEYS7CCZYHL7EFEIQ63UOMJDUB7JXLAOIZG2QN5WS7TXLG`, `GCA63CDLB2TIO74S45VBCUIYBHPSVMBYDNSDPCJX56QYHA225OVXIJ3U`, `GDZ7RHUO624BHAZB4UOZUFGGJ5VCCRHDPRA5Z634UB5F4IZIBLNMVV5Q`, `GA32YJXQEG24OQXNY2JFN2E5KWMDCJN4FRGW7ENTOZKG7RKFSB45WXNR`, `GAQQG3OTZ5UD4CJSFW7JMKBTVGF5EPIW3R3EBLMH5EQ4JL75ZP6A3SL3`."
